                          "description": {
                            "value": "Opening a door that bypasses normal space, you instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to a clear space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you\u2014even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container\u2014the spell is lost."
